    <abstract pn="section-abstract">
      <t indent="0" pn="section-abstract-1">This document defines several subcodes for the BGP Finite State
Machine (FSM) Error that could provide more information to help
network operators in diagnosing BGP FSM issues and correlating
network events.  This document updates RFC 4271.</t>
    </abstract>
